<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 174 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 174 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 87 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills and for 87 million of 182-day NBP-bills at the central bank's 200 million zloty auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
